    "TransferEvent": {
      "index": 5,
      "doc": " A confidential transfer is made from a sender to a receiver. The transferred amount is emitted\n twice: `encrypted_amount_receiver`, the well-formed four-limb encryption under `receiver_pk`,\n and `encrypted_amount_sender`, the same value under `sender_pk` so the sender can recognize\n its own outgoing transfers. `memo` is an opaque caller-supplied blob, empty if none was provided.\n\n TODO: `encrypted_amount_sender` is only verified as part of the batch total (its individual\n value is not range-checked); this representation may change in a future revision.",
      "attributes": [],
      "abilities": [
        "Copy",
